# Vercel builds only the website (shubix/FE/web-app; Root Directory in the project). The other workspace packages keep
# their package.json (pnpm's lockfile lists them all); their code stays out of the upload.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
logs
shubix/logs
shubix/samples
shubix/docs
shubix/infra
shubix/BE/api/*
!shubix/BE/api/package.json
shubix/FE/mobile-app/*
!shubix/FE/mobile-app/package.json
# tests never run on Vercel, and two of them read the phone app, which is not uploaded
shubix/FE/web-app/tests
shubix/FE/web-app/**/*.test.*
